WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:08.270
Film producer Jeffrey Katzenberg was responsible
for reviving Walt Disney Studios by producing

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:14.320
some of their biggest hits including The Lion
King, The Little Mermaid, Beauty and the Beast

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:15.440
and Aladdin.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:21.030
After which he requested a promotion but was
instead abruptly fired.

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:30.400
He swore revenge on the Disney Corporation
and founded DreamWorks Studios.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:36.120
The reason that artificial banana favouring
tastes so different to actual bananas is because

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:41.570
artificial banana flavourings are based on
a type of banana called Gros Michel bananas,

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:45.379
that were wiped out by a plague in the 1950s.

00:00:45.379 --> 00:00:50.679
On an island off the south-west coast of Australia
named “Middle Island” there is a large

00:00:50.679 --> 00:00:55.460
lake that is a bright pink bubblegum colour
called Lake Hillier.

00:00:55.460 --> 00:01:01.059
A mantis shrimp can swing its claw so fast
that it boils the water around and creates

00:01:01.059 --> 00:01:02.559
a flash of light.

00:01:02.559 --> 00:01:05.750
Australia has over 10,000 beaches.

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:10.050
You could visit a brand new beach every day
for over 27 years.

00:01:10.050 --> 00:01:16.050
To determine if a female is suitable for mating
a male giraffe will approach the female and

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:19.520
rub up against her backside until she pees.

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:24.539
The male then tastes the urine to determine
whether she's in heat or not.

00:01:24.539 --> 00:01:29.320
What's even more disturbing is that scientists
thought it necessary to give this bizarre

00:01:29.320 --> 00:01:33.830
ritual a name, it's called the “Flehmen
sequence”.

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:36.979
Nintendo was originally a trading card company.

00:01:36.979 --> 00:01:43.189
There is an uninhabited island in the Bahamas
known as “Pig Beach” which is populated

00:01:43.189 --> 00:01:45.830
entirely by swimming pigs.

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:51.539
A scientist let a computer program a computer
chip using natural selection.

00:01:51.539 --> 00:01:56.840
The outcome was an extremely efficient chip,
the inner workings of which were too complex

00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:58.259
for a human to understand.

00:01:58.259 --> 00:02:04.080
A group of women called “The 9 Nanas”
kept a secret for decades that not even their

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:05.390
husbands knew about.

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:11.730
For 30 years they met at 4am and anonymously
paid bills and bought clothes for people in

00:02:11.730 --> 00:02:12.730
need.

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:17.760
Each care package included a homemade pound
cake and a note that read “Somebody loves

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:18.760
you”.

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:24.690
Approximately 1 million Euros are thrown into
Rome's Trevi fountain every year.

00:02:24.690 --> 00:02:28.580
The money is used to subsidise a supermarket
for those in need.

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:30.290
As a teenager George R.R.

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:36.550
Martin was the first ever person to buy a
ticket to the first ever comic con, held in

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:39.360
New York City in 1964.

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:44.760
When we breathe through our nose, we inhale
more air from one nostril than the other,

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:48.380
but they swap round every 15 minutes.

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:54.330
The mayor of the Alaskan town of Talkeetna
is a cat called Stubbs.

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:59.610
This faithful ball of fur has been of the
town since 1997.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:05.540
In 2013 in China, scientists managed to grow
a human tooth using nothing but stem cells

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:07.400
taken from urine.

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:13.890
In 1969 a musician named Jim Sullivan recorded
an album called “U.F.O” which included

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:19.260
unusual lyrics about leaving his family and
being abducted by aliens.

00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:23.610
Sullivan disappeared six years later without
a trace.

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:35.720
The only evidence was his abandoned car found
on a desert road.

